    "title": "Boxers shut out Whitworth 1-0 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago FOREST GROVE, Ore. – Trenton Zimmermann scored in the 53rd minute and Kobi Miyamoto made four saves as the Pacific men's soccer team shut out Whitworth 1-0 Saturday afternoon at Hanson Stadium. The Boxers improved to 2-3-2 overall and 2-1-2 in Northwest Conference play. After a scoreless first half,... Read full article",
